  {
   "x": 7.55,
   "y": 2.1,
   "w": 5.3,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "τ_zz − τᵣᵣ = 3μ ∂_z v:  extensional stress is three times\nthe shear-viscosity scale.",
   "font": "Arial",
